OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain spreading eastwards
OL,6,Fthrough the morning, becoming
OL,7,Fwidespread and persistent. The rain
OL,8,Fgradually easing from the west through
OL,9,Fthe afternoon and persisting along
OL,10,Feastern coasts until after dark.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSkies will clear over night
OL,13,Fwith some coastal showers in the east
OL,14,Fof the region until the morning.
OL,15,FTemperatures will fall making it feel
OL,16,Fcooler than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
