OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FFine day Thursday after a
OL,6,Fchilly start, becoming overcast from
OL,7,Flate afternoon ahead of rain and
OL,8,Fstronger winds spreading east
OL,9,Fovernight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,12,Fand Saturday, with plenty of drier
OL,13,Fintervals, but also further outbreaks
OL,14,Fof rain. Becoming drier and more
OL,15,Fsettled on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
